WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.264 line:91%
Chapter 1. Install MI WAY Classroom, set it up, and meet the Home page.

00:00:06.676 --> 00:00:16.523 line:91%
To install, open the file "MI WAY Classroom dot APK" on your Android phone, and allow the install. The app appears with your other apps.

00:00:16.976 --> 00:00:21.383 line:91%
The first time the app opens, a short welcome setup starts.

00:00:21.835 --> 00:00:30.445 line:91%
The app works in three steps. Test 1 shows what students already know. Then you teach. Test 2 shows how much they improved.

00:00:30.898 --> 00:00:32.945 line:91%
Press "Let's start".

00:00:33.397 --> 00:00:37.524 line:91%
Write your name and your school. Students see them on their phones.

00:00:37.984 --> 00:00:48.763 line:91%
This page explains how students join. Your phone and the students' phones must be on the same Wi-Fi, or on your phone's hotspot. You do not need the internet.

00:00:49.229 --> 00:00:51.945 line:91%
Now press "Create my class".

00:00:53.001 --> 00:01:05.285 line:91%
Write the name of the class, and choose its level: 1 AC, 2 AC or 3 AC for middle school, or Common Core, 1 Bac or 2 Bac. A Bac class also chooses its book.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:10.285 line:91%
You can also add the timetable of the class. It is optional.

00:01:10.746 --> 00:01:12.625 line:91%
Press "Next".

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:20.085 line:91%
Now add your students. No list yet? Press this button, and students write their own names on their phones.

00:01:20.543 --> 00:01:28.445 line:91%
Here, we paste the list, one name per line. You can also import it from Excel, for example the list from Massar.

00:01:28.903 --> 00:01:31.484 line:91%
Press "Save and open the class".

00:01:31.956 --> 00:01:36.525 line:91%
A short tour shows you the menu. Read it once, or press "Skip tour".

00:01:37.538 --> 00:01:46.384 line:91%
The app opens on Home. Tap the menu button, at the top left. The menu is short: seven pages, and "More" at the bottom.

00:01:46.843 --> 00:01:53.726 line:91%
Your class is at the top. Everything you see is about this class. Press "Switch class" to change it.

00:01:54.177 --> 00:02:01.524 line:91%
On Home, the blue box always shows the next step with this class. Today, a new class starts with a lesson.

00:02:01.987 --> 00:02:04.945 line:91%
The big buttons open what you use most.

00:02:05.398 --> 00:02:10.606 line:91%
The blue "Start" button is always at the top. You will use it in Chapter 5.

00:02:11.059 --> 00:02:21.044 line:91%
Lessons and Results have tabs at the top. For example, Results also has Bonus points, the Skill map, Writing, the Record book and Parents.

00:02:21.506 --> 00:02:29.825 line:91%
At the top of every page: the target button picks a student at random, and the question mark explains the page in a few lines.

00:02:30.284 --> 00:02:36.305 line:91%
"More", at the bottom of the menu, opens your Timetable, Help and videos, and Settings.

00:02:36.759 --> 00:02:39.404 line:91%
That's it! Your class is ready.
